---
title: "borrow (Compound Whitepaper)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: msg.sender calls borrow(amount)
    q_validate --> q_accrue: amount > 0
    q_validate --> q_error_zero: amount = 0
    q_accrue --> q_check_collateral: accrueInterest()
    q_check_collateral --> q_calc_capacity: compute borrowing capacity for msg.sender
    q_calc_capacity --> q_iter_assets: capacity = 0
    q_iter_assets --> q_sum_collateral: for each asset in msg.sender collateral
    q_sum_collateral --> q_iter_assets: capacity = capacity + cTokenBalance * exchangeRate * price * collateralFactor
    q_sum_collateral --> q_compare: all assets processed
    q_compare --> q_check_cash: capacity > totalBorrowValue + amount (sufficient collateral)
    q_compare --> q_error_collateral: capacity <= totalBorrowValue + amount (insufficient collateral)
    q_check_cash --> q_transfer: market.cash >= amount
    q_check_cash --> q_error_liquidity: market.cash < amount
    q_transfer --> q_update_balance: transfer(msg.sender, amount)
    q_update_balance --> q_checkpoint: borrowBalance[msg.sender] = borrowBalance[msg.sender] + amount
    q_checkpoint --> [*]: borrowIndex[msg.sender] = currentIndex; totalBorrows = totalBorrows + amount
    q_error_zero --> [*]: revert
    q_error_collateral --> [*]: revert insufficient collateral
    q_error_liquidity --> [*]: revert insufficient cash

    note right of q_compare
        INV-001: total borrowed value must never exceed borrowing capacity after borrow
        INV-002: borrowing capacity = sum(cTokenBalance_i * exchangeRate_i * price_i * collateralFactor_i) for all collateral assets i
    end note

    note right of q_checkpoint
        INV-003: borrower checkpoint index must equal market index at time of borrow
        INV-004: totalBorrows must increase by exactly the borrowed amount
    end note
